,"document_title_status":""},"say:41:1826049009:1":{"text":"내가 테페시아를 찾아갔을 때, 성 안에 숨어 있었다는 건가?","source_cn":"这么说来，我拜访苔佩希的时候，<male>他</mal...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB5462389448A5723","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"내가 테페시아를 찾아갔을 때, 성 안에 숨어 있었다는 건가?","female":"내가 테페시아를 찾아갔을 때, 성 안에 숨어 있었다는 건가?","variant_male_record_index":"250691","variant_female_record_index":"250692","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1826049010:1":{"text":"그래.","source_cn":"对。<key:dialog88>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD538E2D3636C18DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1826049011:1":{"text":"흥미롭군...","source_cn":"那就有意思了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01858864416CCC9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1826049012:1":{"text":"암살은 성공했겠지? 그 뱀파이어는 틀림없이 중상을 입고 죽어가고 있었고?","source_cn":"你确定你的刺杀没有失手，那只吸血鬼百分之百重伤垂危吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA533475E24A3215C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1826049013:1":{"text":"상태가... 안 좋아. 독을 써서... 피를 멎지 않게 했어.","source_cn":"她……状态很差。我……用毒，让她一直流血。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC104A55BF4565D1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1826049014:1":{"text":"주군은... 뱀파이어가, 과다출혈을 두려워한다고 하셨어.","source_cn":"主君说……吸血鬼害怕，失去太多血液。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x73ED804D3BE54DA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1826049015:1":{"text":"아주 좋아.\n보아하니 너 같은 애완동물도 제법 쓸모가 있군. 네 주군이 괜히 널 기른 건 아니었어.","source_cn":"很好。\\n看来你这宠物还算有用，你的主君没有白养你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB642867E294BE4E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1826049016:1":{"text":"애완동물...? 모르겠어.","source_cn":"宠物……？不明白。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30E9E25A1499361A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1826049017:1":{"text":"이해할 필요 없다. 노바리스의 주인이 곧 바뀐다는 것만 기억하도록. 그리고 그 새로운 영주는 바로 내가 될 거다.","source_cn":"你不需要明白，只需要知道：诺珐斯即将易主。而我，会是新...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E83F3EBBE4D0182","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1826049018:1":{"text":"물러가서 다음 명령을 기다려라.","source_cn":"退下吧，等待我的下一条命令。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF890A0AB74C20CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1826049019:1":{"text":"물러가? 안 돼... 그건 주군의 명령, 아니야.","source_cn":"退下？不行……这不是，主君的命令。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB40E5B69AFE4585A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1826049020:1":{"text":"그리고 <style=\"highlight\">카르마가 성 밖에서... 공격, 준비하고 있어</style>.","source_cn":"而且，<style=highlight>喀尔马在城外…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DF11D0D8B8B4A39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1826049021:1":{"text":"쯧, 멍청한 괴물 자식. 뇌가 두 개나 있으면서 내 채찍보다 눈치가 없다니!","source_cn":"啧！真是愚蠢的怪物，他们那两颗大脑加起来恐怕还不如我的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F70377F920614AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1826049022:1":{"text":"너는... 카르마 형제를 따라가라. 필요한 순간에만 나서도록. 알겠나?","source_cn":"你——跟着喀尔马兄弟，必要时刻再出手，懂吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9814E190269B9DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1826049023:1":{"text":"나서? 어...","source_cn":"出手……？哦……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BE1D5A7E1B9B8A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:贵族昆廷":{"text":"귀족 켄틴","source":"贵族昆廷","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:斯莱泽":{"text":"